    <string name="faq_title">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How does AI Matching work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Our AI analyses your project requirements — budget, service type, and experience level — and scores every provider on our platform to surface your best matches.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">What is the Escrow payment system?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Your payment is held securely in escrow and only released to the provider after you confirm the service has been delivered to your satisfaction.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How are providers verified?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Providers submit a government-issued ID and portfolio. Our team reviews and approves each profile before the Verified badge is issued.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Can I cancel an order?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Yes — orders can be cancelled within 24 hours of acceptance for a full refund. After 24 hours, cancellation terms depend on project stage.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">How do I pay?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">You can pay via Mada, Apple Pay, or credit/debit card. Saved cards are supported for faster checkout.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">How do I contact my provider?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Once an order is placed you can message the provider directly through the in-app chat at any time.</string>
